# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Publication boundary.  Third-party copyrighted material is never committed:
# source PDFs and every citation page image.  The JSTOR page images also carry
# a watermark naming the downloading institution.  The dossier sources still
# build without them, with framed placeholders in place of each image, and
# fresh_audit_2026_08_16/render_evidence.sh regenerates the corpus from local
# copies of the sources, one pinned page per call.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
refs/
**/evidence/
part_ii/dossier_images/
*dossier*.pdf
# Every raster format a page image could arrive in, not just the ones it does: a
# browser saves WebP or AVIF, a phone HEIC, a scanner TIFF or JPEG 2000.  This list
# keeps them out of `git add -A` and out of an unattended commit; the hook tests
# content as well, so a renamed or unlisted format is caught there.
*.png
*.apng
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.jpe
*.jfif
*.pjpeg
*.pjp
*.gif
*.bmp
*.dib
*.tif
*.tiff
*.webp
*.avif
*.avifs
*.heic
*.heics
*.heif
*.heifs
*.hif
*.jxl
*.jp2
*.j2k
*.j2c
*.jpf
*.jpx
*.jpm
*.mj2
*.jxr
*.wdp
*.psd
*.psb
*.xcf
*.ico
*.icns
*.pnm
*.pbm
*.pgm
*.ppm
*.pcx
*.tga
*.qoi
*.exr
*.dng
*.cr2
*.cr3
*.nef
*.arw
*.orf
*.rw2
*.raf
*.djvu
*.djv
# Archives: whatever they hold cannot be inspected.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tgz
*.tbz
*.tbz2
*.txz
*.gz
*.bz2
*.xz
*.7z
*.rar
*.zst
# The second line of defence is .githooks/pre-commit.  Enable it in every clone
# with `git config core.hooksPath .githooks`, and test both files, edited or not,
# with `sh .githooks/selftest.sh`.

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
!part_ii/*checkpoint.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
.DS_Store

# tracked by the private companion repository instead
PRIVATE.md

# output/pdf/ re-publishes some documents unchanged; keep only the unique ones
output/pdf/glimm-jaffe-main-theorem-repaired.pdf
output/pdf/glimm-jaffe-critical-proof-audit-2026.pdf
output/pdf/glimm-jaffe-part-ii-free-fixed-coarse-rate.pdf
output/pdf/glimm-jaffe-part-ii-model-sheet.pdf
output/pdf/glimm-jaffe-part-ii-projective-compactness.pdf
output/pdf/glimm-jaffe-part-ii-weyl-reduction.pdf

